stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> All
  All --> Selected: select loaded key
  Selected --> All: clear selection
  Selected --> Empty: refresh removes selected key
  Empty --> All: clear selection
  Selected --> Selected: edit draft or refresh adds key
  Selected --> All: comparison target is hidden
  All --> Locked: submit review
  Selected --> Locked: submit review
  Locked --> Locked: unconfirmed outcome or blocked selection
  Locked --> All: confirmed retry refreshes
  All --> Retired: auth retirement or dispose
  Selected --> Retired: auth retirement or dispose
  Empty --> Retired: dispose
  Locked --> Retired: auth retirement or dispose
  Retired --> Retired: late response ignored
